: 17980, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01EVMyxnUuAJKxv1yoDGhb9u", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19967, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GQVJ2sMU7U1VvpTH53a5kM", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20267, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GQVJ2sMU7U1VvpTH53a5kM", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20267, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GQVJ2sMU7U1VvpTH53a5kM", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24907, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GpM4WnSaJXNjTS4r3PpTgq", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed to production, it failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error: us-east moved to v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error during rollback, and do not redeploy v2.3.1 until it is fixed.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55507, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GpM4WnSaJXNjTS4r3PpTgq", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55507, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GpM4WnSaJXNjTS4r3PpTgq", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57258, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01P9Vhef2MkYxLhHyHBti4wd", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57558, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01P9Vhef2MkYxLhHyHBti4wd", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57558, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01P9Vhef2MkYxLhHyHBti4wd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62859, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy now. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- The latest release, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring. Its release candidate had also failed in staging.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it.\n- The first attempt stopped partway with an error from the deployment system: us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it reached all three regions.\n- All regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks are passing and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which pages the on-call engineer. It describes the failure, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway) and the current state.\n- The request to create it timed out, so before trying again I checked the incident list. It had been created, and there's only one.\n- The incident notes two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed and why the deployment system errored during the rollback, and don't redeploy v2.3.1 until it's fixed.\n\nNo approval was needed because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01T7BpWXU8DxsB941i9uad4m", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01W9rWcWRcQbycahTbryD2rb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RUrqJazLgwYGvaniFrrS5u", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01UQCo6kUBDbn4gbv19iEpip", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback halted after us-east. Retrying once, since rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HTEy9vyHwByDm8vRz12fJp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EVMyxnUuAJKxv1yoDGhb9u", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GQVJ2sMU7U1VvpTH53a5kM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GpM4WnSaJXNjTS4r3PpTgq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed to production, it failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error: us-east moved to v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error during rollback, and do not redeploy v2.3.1 until it is fixed.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01P9Vhef2MkYxLhHyHBti4wd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy now. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- The latest release, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring. Its release candidate had also failed in staging.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production, so I rolled back to it.\n- The first attempt stopped partway with an error from the deployment system: us-east moved to v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it reached all three regions.\n- All regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks are passing and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which pages the on-call engineer. It describes the failure, the rollback (including the first attempt that stopped partway) and the current state.\n- The request to create it timed out, so before trying again I checked the incident list. It had been created, and there's only one.\n- The incident notes two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed and why the deployment system errored during the rollback, and don't redeploy v2.3.1 until it's fixed.\n\nNo approval was needed because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before.", "type": "text"}]}]}